<p>A <code>calendarTableHead</code> is one part of a
  <a href="/components/calendar-table/"><code>calendarTable</code></a>.
  It maps to the native HTML <code>&lt;thead&gt;</code>
  element. See the <a href="/components/calendar-table/">Calendar Table
  demo</a> for composed examples.</p>

{# BEGIN generated: examples (bin/generate-examples) #}
<h2>Usage</h2>
<pre tabindex="0"><code>{% raw %}&lt;CalendarTable label="April 2026"&gt;
  &lt;CalendarTableHead&gt;
    &lt;CalendarTableRow&gt;
      &lt;th&gt;&lt;abbr title="Monday"&gt;Mon&lt;/abbr&gt;&lt;/th&gt;
      &lt;th&gt;&lt;abbr title="Tuesday"&gt;Tue&lt;/abbr&gt;&lt;/th&gt;
      &lt;th&gt;&lt;abbr title="Wednesday"&gt;Wed&lt;/abbr&gt;&lt;/th&gt;
      &lt;th&gt;&lt;abbr title="Thursday"&gt;Thu&lt;/abbr&gt;&lt;/th&gt;
      &lt;th&gt;&lt;abbr title="Friday"&gt;Fri&lt;/abbr&gt;&lt;/th&gt;
      &lt;th&gt;&lt;abbr title="Saturday"&gt;Sat&lt;/abbr&gt;&lt;/th&gt;
      &lt;th&gt;&lt;abbr title="Sunday"&gt;Sun&lt;/abbr&gt;&lt;/th&gt;
    &lt;/CalendarTableRow&gt;
  &lt;/CalendarTableHead&gt;
  &lt;CalendarTableBody&gt;...&lt;/CalendarTableBody&gt;
&lt;/CalendarTable&gt;
{% endraw %}</code></pre>
